      "text": "San Antonio made a 9-0 push to bring LAL's lead down to as few as 7, before a Kessler put-back, and a Reaves 3 got it back to 66-54. Castle (7 for 9) and Harper (4 of 6) have done the bulk of the work for the Spurs, with an inefficient Wemby night thus far (6 of 17 FG's).",
